 issue for someone that only gets started"}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 4, "created_at": "2020-04-14T19:38:37Z", "updated_at": "2020-09-25T04:40:11Z", "closed_at": "2020-09-25T04:40:11Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "We should add support for multipart statustext messages as specified in https://github.com/mavlink/mavlink/pull/1295.\r\n\r\nHere https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/138ee4acebfbfa5875425048423014cb454ebee4/src/core/system_impl.cpp#L216-L258", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1039/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1039/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/642618154", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1039#issuecomment-642618154", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1039", "id": 642618154, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY0MjYxODE1NA==", "user": {"login": "krady21", "id": 43993819, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTkzODE5", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43993819?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21", "html_url": "https://github.com/krady21", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2020-06-11T12:42:36Z", "updated_at": "2020-06-11T12:42:36Z", "body": "I have a few questions. I assume that the statustext messages can arrive out-of-order, right? In that case, do you think that reordering should be done on the fly or only when we get the last message? Another important aspect is what do we do if we don't receive the last message (the one null terminated). Do we implement some timeout mechanism and log just what has been received up until that point in time?", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/642618154/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/642635131", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1039#issuecomment-642635131", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1039", "id": 642635131, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY0MjYzNTEzMQ==", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2020-06-11T13:05:34Z", "updated_at": "2020-06-11T13:05:34Z", "body": "Good questions. I don't think we try very hard to deal with out-of-order in MAVLink in general, unless for things that are implemented to be guaranteed such as commands or a mission upload.\r\n\r\nWhile a debug output is important the message is just a stream and you can potentially miss it all, that's just currently the state until we have the [events interface](https://docs.google.com/document/d/18qdDgfML97lItom09MJhngYnFzAm1zFdmlCKG7TaBpg) which deals with that using an events counter, if I remember it correctly.\r\n\r\nAnyway, I would suggest to parse and display whatever arrives (in order) and just omit whatever does not. I think that will already bring value for most cases.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/642635131/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/642870987", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1039#issuecomment-642870987", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1039", "id": 642870987, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY0Mjg3MDk4Nw==", "user": {"login": "krady21", "id": 43993819, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTkzODE5", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43993819?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21", "html_url": "https://github.com/krady21", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/krady21/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2020-06-11T18:59:39Z", "updated_at